{
  "name": "livespec family — all activity",
  "description": "Dogfooded telemetry for the livespec family (livespec, impl-beads, dev-tooling, runtime, impl-git-jsonl, driver-claude): CI, Red-Green-Replay commit gates, the beads+fabro dispatcher, sandbox runs, and harness sub-agents. Seeded from the captured-history replay (29f pipeline); live data flows once the 29f.3 sandbox→host hop is verified.",
  "type": "flexible",
  "layout_generation": "manual",
  "tags": [
    {
      "key": "team",
      "value": "livespec"
    },
    {
      "key": "kind",
      "value": "dogfood"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "fleet-nondocs-merged-green-per-hour",
      "dataset": "pr-throughput",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 0,
        "height": 9,
        "width": 12
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "THROUGHPUT — FLEET non-docs PRs merged green per hour",
        "description": "THE ONE METRIC of the throughput track, as one FLEET line: COUNT of merged pull requests whose covering default-branch CI run concluded success, per hour, EXCLUDING docs-only pull requests (every changed path ends in .md) and release-please pull requests (maintainer direction 2026-11-14). One line only: per-repository charts, lead time and stage split are on the board 'livespec throughput'. The pr.docs_only and pr.is_release filters also drop the pre-classification copies the interim writer's backfill left in the dataset. Emitter: the merged-green reconciler (livespec-dev-tooling-gaetnq; until it converges, the interim writer of plan throughput-metric, livespec-dev-tooling-oe7cfw). Definition: spec proposal a-scheduled-graphql-reconciler-emits."
      },
      "query": {
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "pr.merged_green",
            "op": "=",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "column": "pr.docs_only",
            "op": "=",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "column": "pr.is_release",
            "op": "=",
            "value": false
          }
        ],
        "breakdowns": [],
        "time_range": 86400,
        "granularity": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 9,
        "height": 4,
        "width": 6
      },
      "text_panel": {
        "content": "## livespec family — all activity\n\nOne view across the family's dogfooded telemetry. **Sources:** `github-ci` (CI runs + per-check jobs), `livespec-rgr` (Red→Green commit-gate cycles), `livespec-dispatcher` (beads+fabro dispatch stages), `fabro-sandbox` (sandbox runs), `claude-subagents` (harness sub-agents).\n\n_Seeded 2026-06-14 from the captured-history replay (3,311 spans, ~last 60 days). Live emission begins once the 29f.3 sandbox→host OTLP hop is verified. Use the **Service** / **Repo** filters to scope._"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "ci-runs-by-outcome",
      "dataset": "github-ci",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 6,
        "y_coordinate": 9,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "CI runs by outcome",
        "description": "CI workflow runs grouped by conclusion (success / failure / action_required)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "ci.conclusion"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "name",
            "op": "=",
            "value": "ci.run",
            "join_column": ""
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "slowest-ci-checks-p50-p90-ms",
      "dataset": "github-ci",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 17,
        "height": 12,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Slowest CI checks — P50 / P90 (ms)",
        "description": "Per-check CI job durations. check-coverage P90 ~83s is the slow tail (motivates the 7us.8 fastest-first gate)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "ci.job.name"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P50"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "ci.job.name",
            "op": "exists",
            "join_column": ""
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 15,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "red-green-cycle-duration-by-repo-ms",
      "dataset": "livespec-rgr",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 4,
        "y_coordinate": 17,
        "height": 20,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Red→Green cycle duration by repo (ms)",
        "description": "RGR commit-gate cycle time (impl + Red gate + Green gate) per family repo."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "repo"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P50"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "MAX"
          },
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 10,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "dispatcher-stage-durations-ms",
      "dataset": "livespec-dispatcher",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 8,
        "y_coordinate": 17,
        "height": 12,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Dispatcher stage durations (ms)",
        "description": "Per-stage timing of the beads+fabro dispatcher loop (fabro-run, janitor, ledger, etc.)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "name"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P50"
          },
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90"
          }
        ],
        "filters": [
          {
            "column": "name",
            "op": "starts-with",
            "value": "dispatcher.stage.",
            "join_column": ""
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "column": "duration_ms",
            "op": "P90",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 12,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 604800
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "fabro-sandbox-runs-by-status",
      "dataset": "fabro-sandbox",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 0,
        "y_coordinate": 37,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Fabro sandbox runs by status",
        "description": "Dark-factory sandbox dispatch outcomes."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "fabro.status"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 604800
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "query",
      "key": "sub-agent-activity-by-type",
      "dataset": "claude-subagents",
      "query_style": "combo",
      "position": {
        "x_coordinate": 4,
        "y_coordinate": 37,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 4
      },
      "annotation": {
        "name": "Sub-agent activity by type",
        "description": "Harness sub-agent sessions by agent type (general-purpose, livespec-implementer, Explore, ...)."
      },
      "query": {
        "breakdowns": [
          "name"
        ],
        "calculations": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT"
          }
        ],
        "orders": [
          {
            "op": "COUNT",
            "order": "descending"
          }
        ],
        "limit": 10,
        "time_range": 7776000,
        "granularity": 604800
      }
    }
  ]
}
